  "title": "L&T secures offshore order for west coast projects",
  "summary": "L&T Energy has secured a large offshore order from ONGC for the development of the Ratna-I and NLM-14 projects off India's west coast, covering engineering, procurement, construction, and installation activities. This marks a significant expansion of L&T's operations in the region.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "L&T Energy secured a large offshore order from ONGC worth up to ₹5,000 crore for the additional development of the Ratna-I and NLM-14 projects.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The order includes engineering, procurement, construction, and installation of new platforms, subsea pipelines, and brownfield modifications.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "L&T Energy reported a large order classification valued between ₹2,500 crore and ₹5,000 crore.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
